 "en-US-RogerNeural\u0000A budget is more than a list of numbers. A good budget is a plan for action, and Fadi treats it that way. Every year, the finance team builds a fresh budget for the coming period. The process is careful and demanding, and it takes several weeks.":{f:"8d2c9f12ffe13ba2",d:17.976,v:0.880,a:0.160,b:16.920,wd:[0.2, 0.36, 0.88, 1.01, 1.35, 1.72, 1.74, 2.16, 2.36, 3.04, 3.06, 3.48, 3.84, 4.16, 4.18, 4.6, 4.88, 5.48, 5.72, 6.04, 6.52, 6.76, 7.03, 7.37, 7.8, 8.18, 8.45, 9.08, 9.28, 9.8, 9.94, 10.4, 10.82, 11.09, 11.48, 11.76, 12.38, 12.65, 13.16, 13.36, 13.93, 14.32, 14.95, 15.22, 15.42, 15.92, 16.37],e:"00000WS00j-",w:"00-t-bM6-KXecS-nljles-rAB9ADLU-UXVPDIUWS---PI3XUH4FCDG----j---00000000000---aa8R-bcS34+NUXZv-ZbgVt-ZEe-xMWbXX8--HOWbbcS---NL87DuQPbztk--bRmU8--ITaZanc----IZbT--UPD-XYSD37HSSSXXbr---00000000000--q-tgNhHSefhshiXNJEDOphnx+t-qbr--SiSR--JYgkWggXB----gbeU424iQbaRQX-tQQ----KPO----gKScL--WS----COUSX--PXGVE2WcQQKLTTQLBL----000000------jyXPWcGMQPP--WXl--N-----eWPKs-TGEGQP9eDBffnc6TWMA5gbVwghyotk-eoiqbplT--bnoV-----VULXBDI83BbeTj---------------------------",r:"--080Qfv0hUNPZ0EGIGN90ArqsrogX0XUWcojXVZ000cjyUXkxmpol0000I000-----------000RRta0QPZyx1eXUS60SQLW80SnN04fWQUUt00kdWQQPZ000egtuo7bcQ28H00QaFXt00jYRSREP0000jSQY00Xco0UTZoyukZZZUUQA000-----------00B08LeKkZNMK9KJUeinodCKE4180BQA00ZJZa00iTLHVLLUq0000LQNXxzxJbQRabU08bb0000hcd0000LhZPg00WZ0000pdXZU00cUlWnzWPbbhgYYbgqg0000------000000I3UcVPlfbcc00WUG00e00000NVch90YlnlbcsNoqMMEPvYVfrwLQW5LK3D8H0NDJBQCGY00QEDW00000WXgUqojtyqQNYI000000000000000000000000000"},
